{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Throw rocks. Score points. Trick &amp; Treat the system.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chaos Rocks</i> is a physics-based puzzle game where every level challenges you to bounce a rock into one of three buckets using gadgets, angles, and sheer determination; In a custom made Demo just for Halloween. Upgrade your tools, automate your points, and master ridiculous trick shots in a stylized, cartoony albeit ghoulish world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udea8 What's in this Demo?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934120/extras/daad5f3df20b271ff977cfbbb0653bcb.poster.avif?t=1761341887\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934120/extras/daad5f3df20b271ff977cfbbb0653bcb.webm?t=1761341887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934120/extras/daad5f3df20b271ff977cfbbb0653bcb.mp4?t=1761341887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Halloween Demo of Chaos Rocks has all the gameplay features of the intended full game plus:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Graveyard Level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghosts &amp; Pumpkins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic Halloween vibe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheaper Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trick Bucket</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2699\ufe0f What's not in the Halloween Demo?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only one level in the Halloween Demo\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller Support\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saved game progression(but you can still save your progress on the level.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udea3 Three Buckets. Three Fates.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934120/extras/74842e7dd866bc7c4fd6f6c2a93ebf50.poster.avif?t=1761341887\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934120/extras/74842e7dd866bc7c4fd6f6c2a93ebf50.webm?t=1761341887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934120/extras/74842e7dd866bc7c4fd6f6c2a93ebf50.mp4?t=1761341887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Point Bucket</strong> \u2013 Your score machine. Don\u2019t tip it.<br>\ud83d\udd13 Upgrade for bonus points and stability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trick Bucket</strong> \u2013 Hidden. Hard to hit. Worth it.<br>\ud83c\udfaf Score big if you land it. No penalty if you fail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Victory Bucket</strong> \u2013 Land it to beat the level.<br>\ud83c\udf00 Unlock a <strong>Gravity Well</strong> to bend your shot into it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udeb5 Backboards: Your Best (and Worst) Friend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934120/extras/d7b52dcdb18d8fc3327670a52fa129a7.poster.avif?t=1761341887\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934120/extras/d7b52dcdb18d8fc3327670a52fa129a7.webm?t=1761341887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934120/extras/d7b52dcdb18d8fc3327670a52fa129a7.mp4?t=1761341887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own throw path using <strong>9 unique backboards made of 2 materials</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wood </strong>slows the rock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trampolines</strong> boost it</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From flat progress boards to tricky 45\u00b0 corner setups, you'll need the right boards in the right place to land the rock in the bucket.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d Hidden Skulls &amp; Bonus Goals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934120/extras/9175570b6aa1bfb510ff73c995713135.poster.avif?t=1761341887\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934120/extras/9175570b6aa1bfb510ff73c995713135.webm?t=1761341887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934120/extras/9175570b6aa1bfb510ff73c995713135.mp4?t=1761341887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our Halloween level has its own secret <strong>Skull Rocks</strong>.<br>Hit them in build mode for bonus points, to make upgrading easier. You know you want to.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based rock throwing with stylized, cel-shaded visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build elaborate trick shot setups with 9 backboard types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate your income with fully upgradeable drones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk/reward gameplay with 3 unique bucket types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden collectibles and bonus score routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressively challenging levels with new obstacles and layouts</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3934120?t=1761341887","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3934120?t=1761341887","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934120/7aa87b95662d2a1481a085a71fcd6a2f322f5b03/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761341887","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934120/7aa87b95662d2a1481a085a71fcd6a2f322f5b03/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761341887","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Throw rocks. Score points. Trick &amp; Treat the system.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chaos Rocks</i> is a physics-based puzzle game where every level challenges you to bounce a rock into one of three buckets using gadgets, angles, and sheer determination; In a custom made Demo just for Halloween. Upgrade your tools, automate your points, and master ridiculous trick shots in a stylized, cartoony albeit ghoulish world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udea8 What's in this Demo?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934120/extras/daad5f3df20b271ff977cfbbb0653bcb.poster.avif?t=1761341887\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934120/extras/daad5f3df20b271ff977cfbbb0653bcb.webm?t=1761341887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934120/extras/daad5f3df20b271ff977cfbbb0653bcb.mp4?t=1761341887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>