aragraph\" ><strong>Victory Bucket</strong> \u2013 Land it to beat the level.<br>\ud83c\udf00 Unlock a <strong>Gravity Well</strong> to bend your shot into it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udeb5 Backboards: Your Best (and Worst) Friend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934120/extras/d7b52dcdb18d8fc3327670a52fa129a7.poster.avif?t=1761341887\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934120/extras/d7b52dcdb18d8fc3327670a52fa129a7.webm?t=1761341887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934120/extras/d7b52dcdb18d8fc3327670a52fa129a7.mp4?t=1761341887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own throw path using <strong>9 unique backboards made of 2 materials</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wood </strong>slows the rock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trampolines</strong> boost it</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From flat progress boards to tricky 45\u00b0 corner setups, you'll need the right boards in the right place to land the rock in the bucket.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d Hidden Skulls &amp; Bonus Goals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934120/extras/9175570b6aa1bfb510ff73c995713135.poster.avif?t=1761341887\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934120/extras/9175570b6aa1bfb510ff73c995713135.webm?t=1761341887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934120/extras/9175570b6aa1bfb510ff73c995713135.mp4?t=1761341887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our Halloween level has its own secret <strong>Skull Rocks</strong>.<br>Hit them in build mode for bonus points, to make upgrading easier. You know you want to.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based rock throwing with stylized, cel-shaded visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build elaborate trick shot setups with 9 backboard types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate your income with fully upgradeable drones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk/reward gameplay with 3 unique bucket types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden collectibles and bonus score routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressively challenging levels with new obstacles and layouts</p></li></ul>","developers":["Cntrl Kill Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3760450","name":"Chaos Rocks"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934120/6848e9f9c765c9ed5abf983acc320613c022ef5f/header.jpg?t=1761341887","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3934120/2002096175/5811f9f3b8bee040ea9c7bf3860558c50fe0ac1f/1760640850/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761341887","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3934120/2002096175/5811f9f3b8bee040ea9c7bf3860558c50fe0ac1f/1760640850/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761341887","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3934120/2002096175/5811f9f3b8bee040ea9c7bf3860558c50fe0ac1f/1760640850/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761341887","id":257218927,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257218927/movie480.mp4?t=1761341887","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/st